营造出安静、私密的居家氛围。镜框边缘清晰，反射出房间的纵深感，引导视线从人物延伸至背景。\n\n构图采用对称式镜面反射，人物居中，手机与脸庞形成视觉焦点，镜面的反射与现实的叠加构成双重空间，增强画面的立体感与叙事性。视觉引导从手机屏幕出发，自然过渡至少女的面部与身体，再延伸至背景的衣物与家具，形成流畅的视觉路径。\n\n色调以灰、白、紫为主，辅以镜面反射中的深色衣物，整体色彩柔和、统一，无强烈对比，营造出静谧、温暖、略带文艺气息的氛围。光影柔和，来自室内自然光或暖光源，均匀洒在人物身上，使皮肤与衣物纹理清晰可见，阴影柔和不突兀。\n\n整体画面充满生活气息与温柔感，少女的神情与姿态传达出一种自在、放松的日常情绪，镜面的反射与构图的对称赋予画面艺术美感，仿佛一幅静谧的日常插画，记录下一个平凡却珍贵的瞬间。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 2912, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 2893, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true, "disabled": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "主提示", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [318.6094665527344, 116.08282470703125], "pos": [1262.256591796875, -4523.12890625], "id": 558, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 2924, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [615.6897583007812, 888.3990478515625], "pos": [1518.70654296875, -4772.38427734375], "id": 517, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectab